這一份主要是在做 Customer / RM Risk Level / Customer Master Data 的查詢，我建議依照功能分類，之後維護會比較方便。

/*********************************************************************
* Customer / RM Risk Level Investigation SQL
*********************************************************************/
------------------------------------------------------------
-- 1. Customer Preload
------------------------------------------------------------
SELECT
    Record_Stat,
    *
FROM Preload_Customer;
------------------------------------------------------------
-- 2. 查詢 Customer 資料 (BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT)
------------------------------------------------------------
-- 單一 Customer
SELECT
    HighRisk,
    CustomerNo,
    *
FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT
WHERE CustomerNo = '680130';
-- 多筆 Customer
SELECT
    HighRisk,
    CustomerNo,
    *
FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT
WHERE CustomerNo IN
(
'681188',
'682380',
'682572',
'682683',
'683197',
'683497'
);
------------------------------------------------------------
-- 3. 查詢 PB Customer Master
------------------------------------------------------------
SELECT *
FROM PB_CUSTOMER_FACT
WHERE CIF_KEY = 'C76854C0-181D-F111-AE3C-0050568A471B';
------------------------------------------------------------
-- 4. RM Risk Level
------------------------------------------------------------
-- RM Risk Level 生效條件：
-- 1. STATUS = 1
-- 2. QUEUEID 不可為 NULL
SELECT
    Status,
    *
FROM BSADBHK..HRS_CUST_RISK_MGMT
WHERE CIF_KEY = 'C76854C0-181D-F111-AE3C-0050568A471B';
-- 更新 Status
UPDATE BSADBHK..HRS_CUST_RISK_MGMT
SET Status = 1
WHERE CIF_KEY = 'C76854C0-181D-F111-AE3C-0050568A471B';
-- 更新 QueueID
UPDATE BSADBHK..HRS_CUST_RISK_MGMT
SET QueueID = 23
WHERE CIF_KEY = 'C76854C0-181D-F111-AE3C-0050568A471B';
------------------------------------------------------------
-- 5. Customer 基本資料
------------------------------------------------------------
SELECT
    B.CUST_TYPE_CDE                    AS 客戶類型,
    B.CUSTOMER_SEGMENT                 AS 客戶群體,
    B.CUST_NME                         AS 中文姓名,
    B.NATIVE_CUST_NME                  AS 英文姓名,
    B.RecordStatus                     AS 客戶狀態,
    B.REM_CDE                          AS AO_CODE,
    B.REM_NME                          AS AO_NAME,
    ISNULL(B.NATIONALITY_1,'')         AS 客戶國籍,
    '_' + B.BRNCH_NBR                  AS 所屬分行,
    CONVERT(CHAR(8),B.OPEN_DTE,112)    AS 開戶日期
FROM PB_CUSTOMER_FACT B
WHERE CIF_KEY IN
(
'AF6C54C0-181D-F111-AE3C-0050568A471B',
'B66F54C0-181D-F111-AE3C-0050568A471B',
'5A7054C0-181D-F111-AE3C-0050568A471B'
);
------------------------------------------------------------
-- 6. Customer 資料完整性檢查
------------------------------------------------------------
DECLARE @CheckID TABLE
(
    CustomerNo VARCHAR(50)
);
INSERT INTO @CheckID
VALUES
('681474'),
('682380'),
('682572');
SELECT
    J.CustomerNo AS 欲查詢CustomerNo,
    CASE
        WHEN B.CIF_KEY IS NOT NULL
        THEN 'Y'
        ELSE 'N (PB_CUSTOMER_FACT 無資料)'
    END AS PB_CUSTOMER_FACT,
    CASE
        WHEN D.CIF_KEY IS NOT NULL
        THEN 'Y'
        ELSE 'N (BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT 無資料)'
    END AS BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT,
    B.CUST_TYPE_CDE AS 客戶類型,
    B.RecordStatus AS 客戶狀態,
    D.CoreSystem AS 系統來源
FROM @CheckID J
LEFT JOIN BSADBHK..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT D
       ON J.CustomerNo = D.CustomerNo
LEFT JOIN BSADBHK..PB_CUSTOMER_FACT B
       ON D.CIF_KEY = B.CIF_KEY;

我建議之後可以再分成三支 SQL Script

1. Customer Investigation.sql
    * Preload_Customer
    * PB_CUSTOMER_FACT
    * BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT
    * Customer 基本資料
2. RM Risk Investigation.sql
    * HRS_CUST_RISK_MGMT 查詢
    * Status 更新
    * QueueID 更新
3. Customer Data Validation.sql
    * Customer 是否存在
    * PB 與 BSA 對應檢查
    * 資料完整性驗證

這樣比全部放在同一支 SQL 好維護許多，之後找問題也會更快。